#: app/templates/base/about.html:13 app/templates/base/faq.html:15
msgid "What is Myeline?"
msgstr "What is Myeline?"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:15
msgid "Myeline is a platform for monitoring documents and querying them with AI — designed for professionals who need to stay informed without compromising confidentiality."
msgstr "Myeline is a platform for monitoring documents and querying them with AI — designed for professionals who need to stay informed without compromising confidentiality."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:18
msgid "Connect your RSS feeds, add web pages, plug in your cloud drives (Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, Zotero, S3, WebDAV…) so Myeline can index your files (PDF, Word…), and ask questions in natural language. The AI answers by citing its sources. Document understanding happens locally on our servers; the AI that writes the answer is Mistral AI, a French provider hosted in the European Union, contractually committed to never train on your data."
msgstr "Connect your RSS feeds, add web pages, plug in your cloud drives (Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, Zotero, S3, WebDAV…) so Myeline can index your files (PDF, Word…), and ask questions in natural language. The AI answers by citing its sources. Document understanding happens locally on our servers; the AI that writes the answer is Mistral AI, a French provider hosted in the European Union, contractually committed to never train on your data."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:21
msgid "For regulated industries that need everything to stay on-site, our sovereign / on-premise edition runs the full AI pipeline inside your infrastructure — no external API call ever leaves your network."
msgstr "For regulated industries that need everything to stay on-site, our sovereign / on-premise edition runs the full AI pipeline inside your infrastructure — no external API call ever leaves your network."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:26
msgid "The project"
msgstr "The project"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:35
msgid "Myeline was born from a simple need: having a tool that centralises, indexes, and makes searchable the sources that matter — without sending data to third parties. Clara designed and developed the platform as an independent project, with a focus on privacy and local processing."
msgstr "Myeline was born from a simple need: having a tool that centralises, indexes, and makes searchable the sources that matter — without sending data to third parties. Clara designed and developed the platform as an independent project, with a focus on privacy and local processing."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:44
msgid "Our values"
msgstr "Our values"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:49 app/templates/base/home.html:306
msgid "Independence"
msgstr "Independence"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:50
msgid "No advertising. No commercial partnerships. Our only clients are our subscribers. No external influence on the platform's content or direction."
msgstr "No advertising. No commercial partnerships. Our only clients are our subscribers. No external influence on the platform's content or direction."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:56
msgid "Privacy first"
msgstr "Privacy first"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:57
msgid "Document understanding stays on our servers. The AI that writes the answers is Mistral AI — French provider, EU-hosted, contractually committed not to train on your data. Sensitive data is encrypted at rest. Sovereign / on-premise deployments keep everything inside your infrastructure — no external call at all. Infrastructure hosted in France, GDPR-compliant."
msgstr "Document understanding stays on our servers. The AI that writes the answers is Mistral AI — French provider, EU-hosted, contractually committed not to train on your data. Sensitive data is encrypted at rest. Sovereign / on-premise deployments keep everything inside your infrastructure — no external call at all. Infrastructure hosted in France, GDPR-compliant."

#: app/templates/base/about.html:63
msgid "Useful by design"
msgstr "Useful by design"

#: app/templates/base/about.html:64
msgid "Every answer cites its sources with a relevance score. The tool is designed to augment your judgment, not replace it. Transparency over magic."
msgstr "Every answer cites its sources with a relevance score. The tool is designed to augment your judgment, not replace it. Transparency over magic."

